1
00:00:00,522 --> 00:00:03,622
(Sheldon:)Howard, can I ask you
a question?

2
00:00:03,625 --> 00:00:05,525
(Howard:)No.

3
00:00:06,662 --> 00:00:08,162
(Sheldon:)All right, I'll just
toss this out to the room.

4
00:00:08,163 --> 00:00:10,463
(Sheldon:)Um, I was thinking
that the best way

5
00:00:10,466 --> 00:00:12,196
(Sheldon:)to fight my addiction is by

6
00:00:12,201 --> 00:00:14,071
(Sheldon:)weaning myself off in steps.

7
00:00:14,069 --> 00:00:16,139
(Sheldon:)Now, I couldn't find
a caffeine patch,

8
00:00:16,138 --> 00:00:18,538
(Sheldon:)but I did find
what claims to be

9
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:21,610
(Sheldon:)a mind-boosting
caffeine suppository.

10
00:00:21,610 --> 00:00:23,740
(Raj:)Yeah.

11
00:00:23,745 --> 00:00:25,775
(Sheldon:)You know, the interesting fact
about the rectum...

12
00:00:25,781 --> 00:00:27,411
Sheldon!

13
00:00:28,684 --> 00:00:31,084
(Leonard:)We are dealing with
an impossible deadline

14
00:00:31,086 --> 00:00:32,656
(Leonard:)from the Air Force
because of you.

15
00:00:32,654 --> 00:00:35,524
(Leonard:)So have an energy drink,
don't have an energy drink.

16
00:00:35,524 --> 00:00:36,854
(Leonard:)Order suppositories
and shove 'em

17
00:00:36,859 --> 00:00:39,389
(Leonard:)wherever you want,
I don't care!

18
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:42,330
(Sheldon:)You don't shove them.

19
00:00:42,331 --> 00:00:44,131
(Sheldon:)They come with an
easy-glide applicator.

20
00:00:46,902 --> 00:00:49,502
(The Flash:)Right.
Listen to me.

21
00:00:49,505 --> 00:00:51,605
(Leonard:)We can't do anything
until you do your part.

22
00:00:51,607 --> 00:00:54,177
(Leonard:)So get up in front of
this whiteboard and do it!

23
00:00:54,176 --> 00:00:56,406
(Sheldon:)I can't.
Yes, you can.

24
00:00:56,411 --> 00:00:58,211
(Howard:)No...

25
00:00:58,213 --> 00:01:00,383
(Sheldon:)I can't figure out
the math.

